{"ts":"2026-03-30T11:37:45.475Z","stream":"stdout","chunk":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_013YsdYzLjFJXcaWcLhAU3ew\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"The plan document also has encoding issues - all the Korean text is garbled (mojibake). The board user said \\\"글자가 깨져서 내용을 모르겠어\\\" meaning \\\"The characters are broken/garbled so I can't understand the content.\\\"\\n\\nI need to rewrite both the plan document and post a new comment with proper Korean encoding. Let me recreate the plan based on my understanding of the task:\\n\\nThe company:\\n- Sells refurbished laptops at www.refurlab.com\\n- Wants to create SEO-focused sites to capture long-tail keywords\\n\\n\\n- Plans to use reference sites like cocktailfyi.com, mountainfyi.com, colorfyi.com, and unitfyi.com as models\\n- Wants to organize content by laptop model and use case\\n\\nI'll need to rewrite the plan document in Korean with proper UTF-8 encoding to fix the character corruption issue, then post a comment explaining the correction.\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":3300,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":29106,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":3300},\"output_tokens\":8,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"bbdce0c1-fb18-45c3-82da-ad7267a4f949\",\"uuid\":\"933ab66f-2139-4582-a567-fc5ae5057720\"}\n"}
